entory","supportingHeadingsStatus","pending content migration","routeId","routePath","kind","source",{"_636":12,"_637":47,"_638":639,"_640":641,"_642":643,"_644":645},"metadata",{"_29":30,"_31":32,"_15":16,"_596":597,"_598":-5,"_599":600,"_601":602,"_603":604},"schema",[500,501],"headings",[480,481,482,483,484,485,486,487,488,489,490,491,492,493,494,495,496,497,498,499],"sections",[116,117,118,119,120,121,122,123,124],"links",[],"assets",[],"interactions",[],"flags",{"_54":28,"_55":56,"_113":114,"_69":115},"riskNotes","5 images lack width/height; quantified or absolute proof claims require substantiation",[],{"_125":448,"_127":449,"_129":-5,"_130":450,"_132":451,"_134":452},{"_125":412,"_127":184,"_129":-5,"_130":413,"_132":414,"_134":415},{"_125":177,"_127":315,"_129":-5,"_130":373,"_132":374,"_134":375},{"_125":352,"_127":184,"_129":-5,"_130":362,"_132":363,"_134":364},{"_125":244,"_127":315,"_129":-5,"_130":316,"_132":317,"_134":318},{"_125":271,"_127":184,"_129":-5,"_130":272,"_132":273,"_134":274},{"_125":225,"_127":184,"_129":-5,"_130":226,"_132":227,"_134":228},{"_125":183,"_127":184,"_129":-5,"_130":185,"_132":186,"_134":187},{"_125":126,"_127":128,"_129":-5,"_130":131,"_132":133,"_134":135},"order",9,"sourceSelector","section.section.brand-gradient.animate","sourceId","sourceClasses",[180,181,182],"heading",{"_176":177,"_146":178},"blocks",[136,137,138,139,140,141,142],{"_143":132,"_125":175,"_176":177,"_146":178,"_127":179},{"_143":144,"_125":170,"_146":171,"_148":172,"_127":173},{"_143":144,"_125":166,"_146":167,"_148":168,"_127":156},{"_143":144,"_125":162,"_146":163,"_148":164,"_127":156},{"_143":144,"_125":158,"_146":159,"_148":160,"_127":156},{"_143":144,"_125":153,"_146":154,"_148":155,"_127":156},{"_143":144,"_125":145,"_146":147,"_148":149,"_127":150},"type","paragraph",56,"text","Book my free eCommerce automation audit","segments",[151],"a.btn.btn-primary",{"_143":146,"_152":147},"value",55,"Read the post-purchase guide",[157],"a",{"_143":146,"_152":154},54,"Read the returns triage guide",[161],{"_143":146,"_152":159},53,"See eCommerce pricing",[165],{"_143":146,"_152":163},52,"Browse all Silverstone AI services",[169],{"_143":146,"_152":167},51,"If traffic is landing but revenue is leaking, the ‘E-Com Growth Engine’ closes the gap across conversion, support, and repeat purchase. A short call is enough to see how it fits your store and margin.",[174],"p.section-subtitle",{"_143":146,"_152":171},50,"level",2,"Ready to grow revenue without more ad spend?","h2.section-title","section","brand-gradient","animate",8,"section.section.bg-lines.animate",[180,222,182,223,224],{"_176":177,"_146":221},[188,189,190,191,192,193,194],{"_143":132,"_125":220,"_176":177,"_146":221,"_127":179},{"_143":144,"_125":216,"_146":217,"_148":218,"_127":198},{"_143":144,"_125":212,"_146":213,"_148":214,"_127":198},{"_143":144,"_125":208,"_146":209,"_148":210,"_127":198},{"_143":144,"_125":204,"_146":205,"_148":206,"_127":198},{"_143":144,"_125":200,"_146":201,"_148":202,"_127":198},{"_143":144,"_125":195,"_146":196,"_148":197,"_127":198},49,"We provide simple reporting that shows recovered revenue, repeat purchase rates and key flow performance in plain language. This makes it easier to link automation work back to commercial outcomes.",[199],"p",{"_143":146,"_152":196},48,"No. The idea is that the journeys largely run themselves once set up. You will want to review performance periodically, but day-to-day operation should not require extra headcount.",[203],{"_143":146,"_152":201},47,"Yes. We can create different content or logic for key segments such as high-value customers, first-time buyers or specific regions. This allows you to respect local norms and make offers more relevant.",[207],{"_143":146,"_152":205},46,"We build sensible contact rules and frequency caps into your flows. You decide how often customers should hear from you and which events are important enough to trigger messages.",[211],{"_143":146,"_152":209},45,"Part of the initial audit is reviewing what is already in place. We either improve and extend existing flows or replace them where they are not performing. The goal is a coherent set of journeys, not competing messages.",[215],{"_143":146,"_152":213},44,"We focus on mainstream store platforms and common email and messaging tools used by small and mid-sized brands. If you are on a more unusual setup, we can usually still connect using webhooks or simple integrations.",[219],{"_143":146,"_152":217},43,"eCommerce Automation FAQs","bg-lines","parallax-section","compact-section",6,[180,222,182,223,224],{"_176":177,"_146":270},[229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237,238],{"_143":132,"_125":269,"_176":177,"_146":270,"_127":179},{"_143":144,"_125":265,"_146":266,"_148":267,"_127":173},{"_143":132,"_125":263,"_176":244,"_146":264,"_127":246},{"_143":144,"_125":259,"_146":260,"_148":261,"_127":198},{"_143":132,"_125":257,"_176":244,"_146":258,"_127":246},{"_143":144,"_125":253,"_146":254,"_148":255,"_127":198},{"_143":132,"_125":251,"_176":244,"_146":252,"_127":246},{"_143":144,"_125":247,"_146":248,"_148":249,"_127":198},{"_143":132,"_125":243,"_176":244,"_146":245,"_127":246},{"_143":144,"_125":239,"_146":240,"_148":241,"_127":198},42,"Clear pricing and scoped deliverables mean you know exactly what you are getting.",[242],{"_143":146,"_152":240},41,4,"Clear scope and pricing","h4",40,"You retain full control over discounts and incentives used in abandoned-cart and win-back journeys.",[250],{"_143":146,"_152":248},39,"Discount control stays with you",38,"We work with your current stack wherever possible to avoid unnecessary replatforming.",[256],{"_143":146,"_152":254},37,"Works with your stack",36,"Flows are written in your brand voice and reviewed with you before anything goes live.",[262],{"_143":146,"_152":260},35,"Your brand voice first",34,"Keep customer experience consistent while protecting margins and discounts.",[268],{"_143":146,"_152":266},33,"Brand-safe automation, with commercial control",5,[180,222,182,223,224],{"_176":177,"_146":314},[275,276,277,278,279,280,281,282,283,284],{"_143":132,"_125":313,"_176":177,"_146":314,"_127":179},{"_143":144,"_125":309,"_146":310,"_148":311,"_127":173},{"_143":132,"_125":307,"_176":244,"_146":308,"_127":246},{"_143":144,"_125":303,"_146":304,"_148":305,"_127":198},{"_143":132,"_125":301,"_176":244,"_146":302,"_127":246},{"_143":144,"_125":297,"_146":298,"_148":299,"_127":198},{"_143":132,"_125":295,"_176":244,"_146":296,"_127":246},{"_143":144,"_125":291,"_146":292,"_148":293,"_127":198},{"_143":132,"_125":289,"_176":244,"_146":290,"_127":246},{"_143":144,"_125":285,"_146":286,"_148":287,"_127":198},32,"Track performance, test variants and add new journeys as you grow.",[288],{"_143":146,"_152":286},31,"Monitor and optimise",30,"Configure flows in your existing email, SMS and messaging tools, then connect them to your store.",[294],{"_143":146,"_152":292},29,"Build and connect",28,"Identify the highest-impact journeys to build first, such as abandoned carts and post-purchase sequences.",[300],{"_143":146,"_152":298},27,"Prioritise quick wins",26,"Review your store data, key tools and current flows.",[306],{"_143":146,"_152":304},25,"Quick automation audit",24,"Start with high-impact flows, then expand as you learn what converts.",[312],{"_143":146,"_152":310},23,"Audit, build, optimise","section.section.bg-circuit.animate",[180,361,182,223,224],{"_176":177,"_146":360},[319,320,321,322,323],{"_143":132,"_125":359,"_176":177,"_146":360,"_127":179},{"_143":144,"_125":355,"_146":356,"_148":357,"_127":173},{"_143":132,"_125":351,"_176":352,"_146":353,"_127":354},{"_143":144,"_125":347,"_146":348,"_148":349,"_127":198},{"_143":324,"_125":325,"_326":327,"_328":329,"_127":330},"list",22,"ordered",false,"items",[331,332,333,334],"ul",{"_146":344,"_148":345},{"_146":341,"_148":342},{"_146":338,"_148":339},{"_146":335,"_148":336},"Founders spend more time on product, brand, and partnerships.",[337],{"_143":146,"_152":335},"More buyers coming back for a second and third order.",[340],{"_143":146,"_152":338},"Faster answers for customers with simple questions.",[343],{"_143":146,"_152":341},"Higher revenue from traffic and ad spend you already fund.",[346],{"_143":146,"_152":344},21,"Recover more checkout revenue, speed up support, and build repeat-purchase habits without adding headcount.",[350],{"_143":146,"_152":348},20,3,"Turn automation into margin","h3",19,"Turn existing demand into revenue and retention, while keeping support efficient.",[358],{"_143":146,"_152":356},18,"More orders, smoother operations","bg-circuit",[180,222,182,223,224],{"_176":177,"_146":372},[365,366],{"_143":132,"_125":371,"_176":177,"_146":372,"_127":179},{"_143":144,"_125":367,"_146":368,"_148":369,"_127":173},17,"Simple automation can recover checkout revenue and lift repeat purchase rates without more ad spend.",[370],{"_143":146,"_152":368},16,"Benchmark gaps are your growth opportunity",[180,361,182,223,224],{"_176":177,"_146":410},[376,377,378,379,380],{"_143":132,"_125":409,"_176":177,"_146":410,"_127":411},{"_143":144,"_125":405,"_146":406,"_148":407,"_127":173},{"_143":132,"_125":403,"_176":352,"_146":404,"_127":354},{"_143":144,"_125":399,"_146":400,"_148":401,"_127":198},{"_143":324,"_125":381,"_326":327,"_328":382,"_127":330},15,[383,384,385,386],{"_146":396,"_148":397},{"_146":393,"_148":394},{"_146":390,"_148":391},{"_146":387,"_148":388},"Dashboards for recovered revenue, repeat orders, and flow engagement.",[389],{"_143":146,"_152":387},"Post-purchase flows that educate, cross-sell, and invite the next order.",[392],{"_143":146,"_152":390},"FAQ and order-status support that cuts simple tickets fast.",[395],{"_143":146,"_152":393},"Abandoned-cart journeys with sensible timing and offers.",[398],{"_143":146,"_152":396},14,"This bundle connects your store, email, and messaging tools to recover revenue and support buyers faster.",[402],{"_143":146,"_152":400},13,"Recover carts. Grow retention.",12,"Recover lost checkout revenue, streamline support, and increase repeat orders with a coherent set of automated journeys.",[408],{"_143":146,"_152":406},11,"The ‘E-Com Growth Engine’","h2#ecom-growth-engine",1,[180,222,182,223,224],{"_176":177,"_146":447},[416,417,418,419,420],{"_143":132,"_125":225,"_176":177,"_146":447,"_127":179},{"_143":144,"_125":443,"_146":444,"_148":445,"_127":173},{"_143":132,"_125":183,"_176":352,"_146":442,"_127":354},{"_143":144,"_125":126,"_146":439,"_148":440,"_127":198},{"_143":324,"_125":421,"_326":327,"_328":422,"_127":330},10,[423,424,425,426],{"_146":436,"_148":437},{"_146":433,"_148":434},{"_146":430,"_148":431},{"_146":427,"_148":428},"Data sits across too many tools to see what is actually working.",[429],{"_143":146,"_152":427},"Repeat-purchase journeys stay on the to-do list instead of going live.",[432],{"_143":146,"_152":430},"Support teams lose time on the same shipping and returns questions.",[435],{"_143":146,"_152":433},"Most visitors abandon basket before they buy.",[438],{"_143":146,"_152":436},"You already pay for demand. The missed opportunity is converting more visitors and bringing more first-time buyers back.",[441],{"_143":146,"_152":439},"Where growth gets stuck.",7,"Cart abandonment, repeat-purchase drop-off, and manual support quietly erode margin for lean teams.",[446],{"_143":146,"_152":444},"Most of your revenue is leaking after the click.",0,"section.hero.title-band",[478,479],{"_176":412,"_146":34},[453,454,455,456,457,458],{"_143":144,"_125":448,"_146":86,"_148":476,"_127":474},{"_143":144,"_125":412,"_146":84,"_148":473,"_127":474},{"_143":144,"_125":177,"_146":470,"_148":471,"_127":198},{"_143":144,"_125":352,"_146":466,"_148":467,"_127":468},{"_143":144,"_125":244,"_146":463,"_148":464,"_127":150},{"_143":144,"_125":271,"_146":459,"_148":460,"_127":461},"See the ‘E-Com Growth Engine’",[462],"a.btn.btn-secondary",{"_143":146,"_152":459},"Book a free eCommerce automation audit",[465],{"_143":146,"_152":463},"Typical fit: lean brands handling abandoned carts, support questions, returns, and repeat purchase.",[469],"p.hero-context",{"_143":146,"_152":466},"Automation that recovers carts, answers common questions, and nudges customers back without adding headcount.",[472],{"_143":146,"_152":470},[475],"a.hero-breadcrumb__link",{"_143":146,"_152":84},[477],{"_143":146,"_152":86},"hero","title-band",{"_125":448,"_176":412,"_146":34},{"_125":412,"_176":177,"_146":447},{"_125":177,"_176":352,"_146":442},{"_125":352,"_176":177,"_146":410},{"_125":244,"_176":352,"_146":404},{"_125":271,"_176":177,"_146":372},{"_125":225,"_176":177,"_146":360},{"_125":443,"_176":352,"_146":353},{"_125":183,"_176":177,"_146":314},{"_125":126,"_176":244,"_146":308},{"_125":421,"_176":244,"_146":302},{"_125":409,"_176":244,"_146":296},{"_125":405,"_176":244,"_146":290},{"_125":403,"_176":177,"_146":270},{"_125":399,"_176":244,"_146":264},{"_125":381,"_176":244,"_146":258},{"_125":371,"_176":244,"_146":252},{"_125":367,"_176":244,"_146":245},{"_125":359,"_176":177,"_146":221},{"_125":355,"_176":177,"_146":178},{"_125":448,"_502":535,"_504":536,"_506":537},{"_125":412,"_502":503,"_504":505,"_506":507},"types",[511,520,524],"rawJson","{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n    \"mainEntity\": [\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Which platforms do you support?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"We focus on mainstream store platforms and common email and messaging tools used by small and mid-sized brands. If you are on a more unusual setup, we can usually still connect using webhooks or simple integrations.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Will this clash with flows we already have?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Part of the initial audit is reviewing what is already in place. We either improve and extend existing flows or replace them where they are not performing. The goal is a coherent set of journeys, not competing messages.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"How do you avoid over-messaging customers?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"We build sensible contact rules and frequency caps into your flows. You decide how often customers should hear from you and which events are important enough to trigger messages.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Can we personalise messaging by segment or country?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Yes. We can create different content or logic for key segments such as high-value customers, first-time buyers or specific regions. This allows you to respect local norms and make offers more relevant.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Do we need a big team to manage this after launch?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"No. The idea is that the journeys largely run themselves once set up. You will want to review performance periodically, but day-to-day operation should not require extra headcount.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Can we see the impact clearly?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"We provide simple reporting that shows recovered revenue, repeat purchase rates and key flow performance in plain language. This makes it easier to link automation work back to commercial outcomes.\"\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }","parsed",{"_508":509,"_510":511,"_512":513},"@context","https://schema.org","@type","FAQPage","mainEntity",[514,515,516,517,518,